    {
      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Five words before we start. Fix-forward: pasting a correction after a failed prompt; the correction joins the same conversation. Rewind: Esc-Esc in Claude Code, or the slash-rewind command — restores conversation and files to the state before the last prompt. Context: everything Claude sees on the next turn — the running transcript. It grows every turn and shortens on rewind. Andon cord: Toyota's line-stop cable; here, the keystroke that stops the line before you build more on a wrong move. Respecify: rewrite the ask with the missing sentence you now know you meant. Fresh state, no residue.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 34.3,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
      "new_visual_element": "CCDefinitions — five terms",
