      "act": "REWIND — THE HEADLESS EQUIVALENT",
      "lane": "SHELL",
      "narration_text": "So what's the alternative. In the interactive UI it's one keystroke: press Escape twice, or type slash-rewind. The last prompt disappears from the conversation, and any file Claude wrote for it disappears from disk. Then you respecify — the same intent with the sentence you now know you meant. This is a headless session, so I do what rewind does: a new session-id, no --resume, the improved ask from the start. Fresh context. No residue.",
